  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Antigravity System — Innate Technique (3rd level)</em></p><p>At 3rd level, you gained the following benefits through practicing your technique.<br />\n<strong>Light Fall.</strong> As a reaction for 1 CE to falling, you and creatures equal to your proficiency bonus within 120 feet have their rate of descent slowed to 60 feet per round and take no fall damage when you land.  <br />\n<strong>Focused System</strong>. When you use your innate technique, you can choose a number of creatures equal to your CE modifier + your proficiency bonus to be unaffected by your technique.<br />\n<strong>Disorienting Gravity</strong>. Any creature that is lifted upwards by your <em>Antigravity</em> must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failure, they make any attacks at disadvantage and cannot maintain concentration while within your field.</p>",
